			(property "Description" "N-MOSFET transistor, numeric pin numbers matching real footprint pads (name D/G/S retained for pinfn netchecks) -- S=pad1, G=pad4, D=pad5 (merged drain tab) per Infineon BSC057N08NS3 G datasheet Rev.2.5 pin diagram (S1/S2/S3/G4/D5-D8) and onsemi/Fairchild FDMS86250 Rev.C4 pin diagram (identical S1/S2/S3/G4/D5-D8 Power-56 layout); used for Q20 (PQFN-8-EP_6x5mm_P1.27mm_Generic), Q22/Q23 (TDSON-8-1). Redundant same-net pads (S2/S3, D6-D8) are not individually bound -- physically merged/adjacent copper, standard for this package class."
